        "data": {
            "type": "game",
            "name": "Spell Casting: Meowgically Enhanced Edition",
            "steam_appid": 522990,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Casting is  free because it was made in 2016 using Construct 2 and I am no longer supporting the game.  If it run and you can play it, great, but there is no need to submit any bug reports anymore as I cannot fix it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Casting is a line drawing puzzle game in which you are a young wizard learning spells in the comfort of your home thanks to Wizardly Distance Education offered by the prestigious Magical Education Of Wizards School!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522990/extras/00371a06ee7f127d95b177a497272107.avif?t=1728337795\" width=625 height=592 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice casting spells by tracing out the patterns in the spell books using your mouse (or finger if using a touchscreen laptop / tablet). Earn a 3 star rating in each practice spell to unlock the exam for that book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to remember the previously learned spell shapes to pass the exam and unlock new spell books!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Casting is fun for all ages and family friendly.  Play just for fun or try to achieve 5 stars in all the spells and exams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Casting supports accessibility by supporting touch screen tablet devices and also allows you to hold down the Space Bar when drawing instead of clicking the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522990/extras/3554adb902f1e4e7af6c535dd4233c2e.avif?t=1728337795\" width=625 height=343 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Casting is  free because it was made in 2016 using Construct 2 and I am no longer supporting the game.  If it run and you can play it, great, but there is no need to submit any bug reports anymore as I cannot fix it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Casting is a line drawing puzzle game in which you are a young wizard learning spells in the comfort of your home thanks to Wizardly Distance Education offered by the prestigious Magical Education Of Wizards School!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522990/extras/00371a06ee7f127d95b177a497272107.avif?t=1728337795\" width=625 height=592 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice casting spells by tracing out the patterns in the spell books using your mouse (or finger if using a touchscreen laptop / tablet). Earn a 3 star rating in each practice spell to unlock the exam for that book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to remember the previously learned spell shapes to pass the exam and unlock new spell books!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Casting is fun for all ages and family friendly.  Play just for fun or try to achieve 5 stars in all the spells and exams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Casting supports accessibility by supporting touch screen tablet devices and also allows you to hold down the Space Bar when drawing instead of clicking the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522990/extras/3554adb902f1e4e7af6c535dd4233c2e.avif?t=1728337795\" width=625 height=343 /></span></p>",
            "short_description": "Spell Casting is a line drawing puzzle game in which you are a young wizard learning spells in the comfort of your home thanks to Wizardly Distance Education offered by the prestigious Magical Education Of Wizards School!",
